  "body": "The \"with the clone children flag set to true\" is kinda clunky in prose... it would be amazing to have \"deeply clone\" shorthand that does the same thing. \r\n\r\nFor example, instead of:\r\n\r\n> Let _clone_ be a clone of _someElementOrFragment_, with the clone children flag set to true.\r\n\r\nNicer: \r\n> Let _clone_ be a **deep clone** of _someElementOrFragment_.\r\n\r\n",
